      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "`rocket` is a symbolic link placed in\n`/usr/local/bin/rocket`\nthat points to the location of the rocket.py file.\n\nThen rocket.py has a shebang for #!/usr/bin/env python3.\nSo this is equivalent to `python rocket.py run`\n\nSee ./setup.sh for more ",
      "fontSize": 28,
      "fontFamily": 8,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "`rocket` is a symbolic link placed in `/usr/local/bin/rocket`\nthat points to the location of the rocket.py file.\n\nThen rocket.py has a shebang for #!/usr/bin/env python3.\nSo this is equivalent to `python rocket.py run`\n\nSee ./setup.sh for more ",
      "autoResize": false,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
